###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Test-time training and radius refinement produce a per-molecule modified model, which schema 0.1.2 cannot express; their errors are in result comments, not separate metrics.
# - The MACE-OFF model evaluated (4.7M parameters, trained on 951k SPICE samples) is not named by size, so it is not linked to a kovacs2025 model. JMP on ANI-1x (Table 8), the GemNet-dT models on MD17/MD22 subsets (Tables 7 and 10) and the xTB-prior run labelled GemNet-dT (Table 6: 78.3 to 56.6 meV/A) are not encoded.
# - GemNet-T, GemNet-dT and GemNet-OC are all encoded as the registry method GemNet (variants are not methods). Reference levels of SPICE and OC20 are not restated in the parts read, so the data sets carry no reference calculation.
# - Read from the arXiv v2 preprint, whose title differs from the Digital Discovery article; arXiv id matched by title and author.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

